<title>UK: Cofinoga sets 990 million French franc bond.</title>
<headline>Cofinoga sets 990 million French franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Agricole and CPR.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COFINOGA</p>
<p> AMT    990 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.35	MATURITY    14.APR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.71    PAY DATE    14.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.7	 REOFFER    100.41    SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) FIVE	GOV LAW     FRENCH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
